<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 111,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Wednesday 111,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Wednesday's actual 111,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts were $1.00 to $1.50 lower than the mid-session Wednesday. Top $49.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>			    Country		  Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    47.00 -48.00	   48.00 -49.00</p>
<p>few			46.50 &amp;48.50	   47.50 &amp;49.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady/off $2.00. Top $50.00. US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  41.00 -42.00	   42.00 -45.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   42.00 -44.00	   43.00 -46.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    45.00 -50.00	   47.00 -50.00</p>
